type: dataset
title: "Consciousness by Design: Engineered Subjective Experience in AI Systems"
authors:
  - family-names: Wikström
    given-names: Björn
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-4015-2357"
    affiliation: "Base76 Research Lab, Skåne, Sweden"
    email: bjorn@base76.se
repository-code: "https://github.com/Applied-Ai-Philosophy/Consciousness-by-Design"
abstract: "This work explores whether consciousness can be engineered by design rather than emerging by accident. Building on the Field-Node-Cockpit (FNC) framework, it proposes architectural principles for creating AI systems with genuine subjective experience. If consciousness requires Field access, Node processing, and Cockpit rendering—and if these are structural rather than substrate-specific requirements—then we can design systems that implement these principles deliberately."
